{
  "name": "poison-ticks",
  "why": "S16: a Toxin Rifle hit starts the poison stack, which ticks once a second off the outermost pool; a second hit refreshes it to full duration without a second clock and names the new applier; the stack runs out; then a lethal tick books the death and no tick follows on a dead gun.",
  "source": "app/test/poison.test.mjs 'S16: a toxin hit starts the stack', 'a second hit REFRESHES', 'a LETHAL tick books the death'",
  "runners": ["engine","stage"],
  "setup": {
    "config": {"respawn":{"type":"auto","delay_s":5}},
    "frames": {"dot":{"11":{"weapon_id":"toxin_rifle","per_tick":4,"tick_ms":1000,"duration_ms":5000}}},
    "gun": {"life":true},
    "fields": ["poison"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {"advance_ms":10},
    {"advance_ms":3000},
    {"check":"live","preamble":true},
    {"frames":["$HIR,0,11,3,2,8,0,0,*","$HP,45,62,0,*"]},
    {"check":"poisoned"},
    {"advance_ms":1000},
    {"check":"tick_1"},
    {"advance_ms":1500},
    {"check":"tick_2"},
    {"frames":["$HIR,0,11,5,2,8,0,0,*","$HP,45,46,0,*"]},
    {"check":"refreshed_by_5"},
    {"advance_ms":1000},
    {"check":"tick_3"},
    {"advance_ms":10000},
    {"check":"stack_ran_out"},
    {"frames":["$HP,4,0,0,*"]},
    {"advance_ms":3000},
    {"frames":["$HIR,0,11,3,2,0,0,0,*"]},
    {"check":"poisoned_at_4_hp"},
    {"advance_ms":1000},
    {"check":"lethal_tick"},
    {"advance_ms":3000},
    {"check":"no_ticks_on_a_dead_gun"}
  ],
  "stage_ignores": [
    {"what":"state.phase","why":"The stage has no MC link, so it has no match phase; it is armed and spawned by its own buttons."},
    {"what":"state.deaths","why":"The stage keeps no death count (MC and the HUD read the engine's); `alive` is compared instead."},
    {"what":"state.ammo","why":"DIVERGENCE: engine.js `feedFrame` LCD case takes the magazine (t5) into `ammo` through `_onAmmo`; stage.py `_on_lcd` reads only the pools, so the stage's `ammo` stays null until an `$ALCD`."},
    {"what":"state.reserve","why":"DIVERGENCE: the same LCD gap as state.ammo: the engine takes the `$LCD` reserve (t6), the stage does not."},
    {"what":"write:$GLED","why":"Harness timing: the stage's gun-body readout animation runs on its injected `sleep`, which is instant in this runner, while the engine's runs on its tick clock, so the same frames land at different checkpoints."},
    {"what":"write:$HLOOP,1,","why":"Harness timing: the down rearm waits 2.5 s on the stage's instant `sleep` but on the engine's clock (both use `rearm_after_ms`), so it lands at a different checkpoint."},
    {"what":"write:$IRTX","why":"DIVERGENCE: the stage does not model the S57 IR callouts (engine.js `_irCallout`): a dying engine sends the kill-confirm and DOWN words over `$IRTX`, the stage sends nothing."},
    {"what":"write:$PLAY,,4,6,H31,","at":"tick_1","why":"DIVERGENCE: the first poison tick is silent on the engine (F446: engine.js `_poisonStrike` plays `poison_tick` only when the gun has no write outstanding and the announcer is idle, and the H12 onset is still on air); the stage gates on the hill callout only (stage.py `_poison_tick`), so it plays H31 on every tick."}
  ],
